  "fluff": {
    "overview": "<p>The AFFS treats its infantry as professionals rather than expendable garrison filler, drawing soldiers from single worlds or neighboring systems to build the unit cohesion that the Federated Suns considers essential to effective combined-arms operations. Towing ultra autocannon that can fire at twice normal rate, these field gun crews provide burst-fire capability that increases their punch against armored targets at the cost of increased ammunition consumption.</p>"
